1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,619
Each such group is a tissue: a group of cells of common origin, similar in structure, working together for one function.

2
00:00:08,619 --> 00:00:11,484
The study of tissues is histology.

3
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:20,156
The study of the inside of plants is plant anatomy, founded in the sixteen seventies by Nehemiah Grew and Marcello Malpighi.

4
00:00:20,156 --> 00:00:22,708
Grew is called the father of plant anatomy.

